-name>, <string-name><surname>Maier</surname> <given-names>K</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Hartmann</surname> <given-names>F</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Steinhardt</surname> <given-names>HJ</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Muller</surname> <given-names>C</given-names></string-name>, <etal/><article-title>Cell-mediated cytotoxicity in hepatitis A virus infection.</article-title><source>Hepatology</source> <year>1986</year>;<volume>6</volume>:<fpage>1308</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>14</lpage> <pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/hep.1840060614</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3025069</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>